    <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>My Love ❤️</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4d6d, #c9184a, #720026);
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .container {
        padding: 80px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 48px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .heart {
        font-size: 100px;
        animation: beat 1s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes beat {
        0%, 100% {
            transform: scale(1);
        }
        50% {
            transform: scale(1.25);
        }
    }

    button {
        margin-top: 25px;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 30px;
        background: white;
        color: #c9184a;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
        cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover {
        background: #ffe5ec;
    }

    #message {
        display: none;
        margin-top: 25px;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .floating-heart {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -50px;
        font-size: 30px;
        animation: float 6s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes float {
        0% {
            transform: translateY(0);
            opacity: 1;
        }

        100% {
            transform: translateY(-110vh);
            opacity: 0;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="heart">❤️</div>

    <h1>My Love</h1>

    <p>
        Welcome to my little world of love ❤️
        <br>
        Every moment is special.
        <br>
        Keep smiling and stay happy! 😊
    </p>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">
        Click Here ❤️
    </button>

    <div id="message">
        You are very special! ❤️✨
    </div>

</div>

